n Jalhaven?\", \"Right, and out of all that, which ones are birthday things? Just want to make sure I don't miss any.\"], [\"umm what's… what have I got on while I'm off in Jalhaven?\", \"ok and just the, uh, the birthday ones out of those?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0033\", \"v\": [[\"ok so, umm, new task — pay the pigeon bill\", \"oh and, uh, can you pull up Hyejin Ellingham's contact card?\", \"and… Thavmoara Theskino?\"], [\"add a task pay the pigeon bill\", \"diff thing, can u show me Hyejin Ellingham's contact\", \"and Thavmoara Theskino?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0034\", \"v\": [[\"umm what time is the… the linen thing?\"], [\"I've got something to do with linen at some point and I've completely lost track of when, so what time is the linen thing again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0035\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a card sorted early this year, so when's Iara's birthday again?\", \"Oh and while I'm at it, what about Crevir Ferrani's?\", \"Different thing — I'm going through the bills for the Damdale house share and want to check the big ones, so which expenses there are above one hundred and sixty pounds?\"], [\"when's Iara's birthday\", \"and Crevir Ferrani's?\", \"also wanna see Damdale house share expenses above one hundred and sixty pounds pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0036\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's the wifi at the, uh, Jathoe Lido?\", \"hang on, quick one — how much do I owe Rohit Horak?\", \"ok going back to the wifi thing… what do my photos have on it?\"], [\"I'm heading down for a swim later and my data's nearly gone, so what's the wifi at the Jathoe Lido?\", \"Sorry, random question before I forget — Rohit mentioned money the other day, how much do I owe Rohit Horak?\", \"Ok, back to the lido wifi — I'm sure I took a snap of the sign once, so what have my photos got on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0037\", \"v\": [[\"ok so can you, um, settle up with Prestou in the Pecs trip?\", \"oh and, uh, which expenses were over 160 pounds?\"], [\"settle up with Prestou, Pecs trip\", \"expenses over 160 pounds?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0038\", \"v\": [[\"seventeen pounds, Prestou's tickets, Pecs trip — I paid\", \"expenses over one hundred and sixty pounds?\", \"just the quay ones\", \"which group's it in?\", \"hang on — who's at the pick?\", \"find expenses on Pecs\"], [\"Could you add seventeen pounds for Prestou's tickets to the Pecs trip, please? I paid for them.\", \"On a different note, could you tell me which expenses came to over one hundred and sixty pounds?\", \"Would you mind narrowing those down to just the quay ones?\", \"Could you tell me which group that one belongs to?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment — could you tell me who will be at the pick?\", \"Separately, would you please find the expenses on Pecs?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0039\", \"v\": [[\"umm how much has been spent, like in total, in the Damdale house share group?\", \"oh and can you, uh, note down that I had coffee with Dorie Vrestova?\"], [\"how much has gone out in the Damdale house share group\", \"also log that i had coffee w Dorie Vrestova\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0040\", \"v\": [[\"can you show me, umm, pictures with Iara in them?\", \"ok just the… the ones from last month?\"], [\"Iara asked me to send her some shots of us, so could you find the photos she's in?\", \"Actually she only wanted the recent stuff, so just the ones from last month please.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0041\", \"v\": [[\"umm when am I next at Drynnoe Fields?\", \"oh, is it, uh, in my pictures as well?\", \"ok different thing — what's on at Drynnoe Fields?\", \"and, umm, whose birthdays are coming up the next two weeks?\", \"nah… leave it\"], [\"when am i next at Drynnoe Fields\", \"is it in my pictures too\", \"also whats on at Drynnoe Fields\", \"whose bdays are coming up in the next two weeks\", \"nah leave it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0042\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which group the butterscotch went into, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the other expenses in that group?\", \"Could you tell me how much the salmon one was?\"], [\"I'm going over the shared spending and can't remember where I put it — which group did the butterscotch end up in?\", \"Ah right, while I'm looking, can you pull up everything else that's in that group too?\", \"The salmon one looks a bit steep to me, how much did that actually come to?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0043\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when Crevir's birthday is, please?\", \"On another note, would you show me any wifi entries in my locker?\", \"Could I have the password for the Jathoe one, please?\", \"Separately, could you show me the linen tasks, mark the first one as done and delete the second, please?\", \"And finally, could you tell me how much I've spent on salmon in total?\"], [\"Crevir's birthday?\", \"wifi entries in locker?\", \"Jathoe one's password\", \"linen tasks — tick first, bin second\", \"salmon total spent?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0044\", \"v\": [[\"I think I've double-booked myself next week somewhere, so when's my dinner with Crevir?\", \"Ah, actually, never mind, I'll sort it out myself.\", \"Although, now that I think about it — who's coming to that?\"], [\"umm when's my, uh, dinner with Crevir?\", \"oh… never mind\", \"wait, who's, um, who's coming to it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0045\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please put a haircut in my calendar for tuesday at 10am?\", \"Also, would you log forty pounds of parking in the Pecs trip? I paid for it.\", \"Could you show me the expenses for the second one, please?\"], [\"haircut tuesday at 10am\", \"forty pounds parking, Pecs trip, I paid\", \"second one's expenses?\"]]}","ttft_ms":10123,"type":"result","duration_ms":29841,"uuid":"0fd9b3d5-3125-46fc-ae51-dc40be4aa0b6","ttft_stream_ms":1454,"time_to_request_ms":181,"first_content_frame_ms":1455,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22640999,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279191534.6257,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
